    dcterms:title "Unicode Character Database 18.0.0, UnicodeData.txt" ;
    dcterms:creator "Unicode, Inc." ;
    rdfs:comment "Licence: Unicode License v3 (SPDX Unicode-3.0), recorded as \"unknown\" only because the builder has no licence id for it. https://www.unicode.org/copyright.html (where https://www.unicode.org/terms_of_use.html now redirects): \"All Unicode Data Files and Unicode Software are subject to the terms and conditions of the free and open-source Unicode License v3\"; https://www.unicode.org/license.txt (Unicode License v3) permits use \"without restriction\" \"provided that either (a) this copyright and permission notice appear with all copies of the Data Files or Software, or (b) this copyright and permission notice appear in associated Documentation.\" Because the licence is notice-requiring and not among the builder's ids, the database is used for verification only: nothing is copied from it."@en .

<https://svenska.se/saol/>
