<https://sprakbanken.se/en/resources/saldo>
    dcterms:title "SALDO (Swedish Associative Thesaurus), development version through Språkbanken's Karp API (v7), queried 2026-10-04" ;
    dcterms:creator "Lars Borin, Markus Forsberg, Lennart Lönngren; Språkbanken Text, University of Gothenburg" ;
    dcterms:license <https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/> ;
    rdfs:comment "https://sprakbanken.se/en/resources/saldo: the resource's metadata table gives \"saldo.xml lexicon (LMF) 70.98 MB 2017-09-19 CC-BY-4.0\" and \"Licence … CC-BY-4.0\"; the page's description also says \"All components are released under a Creative Commons Attribute-Share Alike license.\" Either way SALDO is used for verification only: nothing is copied from it."@en .

<https://sv.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?title=Grekiska_alfabetet&oldid=59450821>
    dcterms:title "Grekiska alfabetet (Swedish Wikipedia), revision 59450821" ;
    dcterms:creator "Wikipedia contributors" ;
    dcterms:license <https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/> ;
    rdfs:comment "https://foundation.wikimedia.org/wiki/Policy:Terms_of_Use, section 7: \"When you submit text to which you hold the copyright, you agree to license it under: Creative Commons Attribution-ShareAlike 4.0 International License (\"CC BY-SA 4.0\"), and GNU Free Documentation License (\"GFDL\").\""@en .

<https://www.ne.se/uppslagsverk/>
    dcterms:title "Nationalencyklopedin (NE), uppslagsverket, entries for the Greek letter names" ;
    dcterms:creator "NE Nationalencyklopedin AB" ;
    rdfs:comment "https://www.ne.se/info/upphovsratt/: \"Nästan allt material på NE.se omfattas av upphovsrättslagen. … Ingen kopiering får göras utan tillstånd.\" Texts from the encyclopedia may be quoted \"i icke-kommersiellt syfte\" with attribution; that is a non-commercial permission, so NE is used for verification only: nothing is copied from it."@en .

